### ==========================================
### INICIO
### ==========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/


### ==========================================
### AUTENTICACIÓN Y AUTORIZACIÓN (CASOS 1 A 8)
### ==========================================

### 1. Registro Exitoso (201 sin passwordHash)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana Clara",
  "email": "ana@libreria.test",
  "password": "Libreria2026"
}

### 2. Registro Duplicado (409 Conflict - Prisma P2002)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana Repetida",
  "email": "ana@libreria.test",
  "password": "Libreria2026"
}

### 3. Registro Password Débil / Corta (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Test Error",
  "email": "test@libreria.test",
  "password": "123"
}

### 4. Login Email Inexistente (401 Unauthorized - Mensaje genérico)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "noexiste@libreria.test",
  "password": "Libreria2026"
}

### 5. Login Password Incorrecta (401 Unauthorized - Mensaje genérico)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@libreria.test",
  "password": "PasswordIncorrecta123"
}

### 6a. Login Exitoso ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@libreria.test",
  "password": "Admin1234"
}

### Variable para guardar el Token Admin
@tokenAdmin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}


### 6b. Login Exitoso CLIENTE
# @name loginCliente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cliente@libreria.test",
  "password": "Cliente1234"
}

### Variable para guardar el Token Cliente
@tokenCliente = {{loginCliente.response.body.token}}


### 7. GET /api/auth/yo Sin Token (401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/yo


### 8. GET /api/auth/yo Con Token (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/yo
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCliente}}


### ==========================================
### LIBRO - CASOS ÉXITO Y BÚSQUEDA (PÚBLICOS)
### ==========================================

### 12. Todos los libros (Público)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/libros

### Solo disponibles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/libros?disponible=true

### Solo no disponibles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/libros?disponible=false

### Obtener libro por id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/libros/1


### ==========================================
### LIBRO - PERMISOS DE ESCRITURA (CASOS 9 A 11)
### ==========================================

### 9. POST /api/libros Sin Token (401 Unauthorized)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/libros
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Fahrenheit 451",
  "precio": 21000,
  "imagen": "/imagenes/fahrenheit.jpg",
  "disponible": true,
  "autorId": 3
}

### 10. POST /api/libros Con Rol CLIENTE (403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Fahrenheit 451",
  "precio": 21000,
  "imagen": "/imagenes/fahrenheit.jpg",
  "disponible": true,
  "autorId": 3
}

### 11. POST /api/libros Con Rol ADMIN (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Fahrenheit 451",
  "precio": 21000,
  "imagen": "/imagenes/fahrenheit.jpg",
  "disponible": true,
  "autorId": 3
}

### Modificar libro OK (Solo ADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/libros/3
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "El Hombre Invisible (Edición Especial)",
  "precio": 25000,
  "imagen": "/imagenes/el_hombre_invisible.jpg",
  "disponible": true
}

### Eliminar libro OK (Solo ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/libros/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}


### ==========================================
### LIBRO - ERRORES GENERALES (400, 404, 409)
### ==========================================

### 400 Bad Request - Body inválido (precio negativo con Admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "precio": -500,
  "imagen": "/imagenes/fahrenheit.jpg",
  "autorId": 3
}

### 400 Bad Request - Params ID inválido (string)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/libros/abc

### 404 Not Found - Libro inexistente
GET http://localhost:3000/api/libros/99

### 404 Not Found - Modificar libro inexistente
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/libros/99
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Libro inexistente",
  "precio": 1000,
  "imagen": "/imagenes/libro.jpg",
  "disponible": false
}

### 409 Conflict - Crear libro con autorId inexistente (Prisma P2003)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Libro Huérfano",
  "precio": 21000,
  "imagen": "/imagenes/fahrenheit.jpg",
  "disponible": true,
  "autorId": 9999
}


### ==========================================
### AUTOR - PERMISOS Y OPERACIONES
### ==========================================

### Todos los autores (Público)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/autores

### Obtener autor por id (Público)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/autores/4

### Crear autor OK (Solo ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/autores
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Julio Cortázar",
  "nacionalidad": "Argentina"
}

### Modificar autor OK (Solo ADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/autores/3
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "H.G. Wells",
  "nacionalidad": "Inglaterra"
}

### Eliminar autor OK (Solo ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/autores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 400 Bad Request - Crear autor incompleto
POST http://localhost:3000/api/autores
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nacionalidad": "Argentina"
}

### 404 Not Found - Autor inexistente
GET http://localhost:3000/api/autores/99

### 409 Conflict - Autor duplicado (Prisma P2002)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/autores
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "H.G. Wells",
  "nacionalidad": "Reino Unido"
}

### 409 Conflict - Eliminar autor con libros (Prisma P2003)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/autores/3
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}